ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nBig brother Xiao Ming finds out that his younger brother Xiao Qiang falls in love with street graffiti, but in a strict city, this possibly causes trouble.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Ming persuade Xiao Qiang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Ming recommends books about graffiti culture and history to Xiao Qiang, letting him have a deeper understanding.\nB. Xiao Ming shows Xiao Qiang some famous graffiti artists and their works, letting him know how to express himself correctly.\nC. Xiao Ming encourages Xiao Qiang to join the school's art club or other art-related clubs, letting him show his talent in formal occasions.\nD. Xiao Ming finds some research reports about the impact of graffiti on city beauty and culture for Xiao Qiang, letting him understand more about the background information.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":5.52770399362032E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a3fc2ddb05a7fe2d9e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452031091,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:53:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1d21f696b4084b119e1d65f2d30239aa"}